# Source is text, and git has to be told so.
#
# Git calls a blob binary when it finds a NUL byte on EITHER side of a diff, so
# one stray control character in a string literal hides a whole file behind
# "Bin 3834 -> 6556 bytes": the change is unreviewable, and `git blame`,
# `git add -p` and patch-based merges all degrade with it. Naming the `diff`
# attribute keeps these formats textual whatever ends up inside them.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
*.js diff
*.vue diff
*.json diff
*.jsonc diff
*.md diff
*.toml diff
*.yaml diff
*.yml diff
